# ALICE Test7 camera feature mount for dream2lte / Android 16.
# Match device identity and Android API, not a single spoofed framework fingerprint.
# This avoids silently disabling the feature XML after a minor One UI port update.
# Only the feature XML is overlaid; no HAL implementation is replaced here.
# Runtime success must be confirmed in init logs and Samsung Camera preview.
on post-fs-data && property:ro.product.vendor.device=dream2lte && property:ro.build.version.sdk=36
    mount none /vendor/etc/alice-test7/camera-feature.xml /system/cameradata/camera-feature.xml bind
